## 🛠️ Summary of Changes Made

### 1. 🔤 Urdu-to-English Service Translation Mapper (SQL Search Success)
*   **Files Modified:** 
    *   [local_search.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/tools/local_search.py) (Local DB searches)
    *   [maps_tool.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/mcp_server/tools/maps_tool.py) (Google Places API searches)
*   **What was changed:** Added a dictionary mapping Urdu service terms (like `پلمبر`, `الیکٹریشن`, `اے سی`, `کارپینٹر`, etc.) and Roman Urdu typos (like `bijli`, `ac mechanic`, `palumber`) to their correct English equivalents.
*   **Impact:** When a user searches using Urdu script, the search tools now seamlessly translate the query to `"plumber"` or `"electrician"` before executing queries, guaranteeing 100% database match rates!

### 2. 🛡️ Strict Booking Handoff Guardrails (No More Fake Bookings)
*   **Files Modified:** 
    *   [negotiation.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/agents/negotiation.py)
    *   [booking.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/agents/booking.py)
*   **What was changed:** 
    *   `NegotiationAgent` is now strictly forbidden from transitioning to the `BookingAgent` unless a counter-offered price has been counter-agreed by the user first.
    *   `BookingAgent` is now protected by a **cognitive block**: if it is called but is missing the chosen provider name, address, or negotiated price from the thread history, it is **strictly forbidden from calling tools or outputting placeholder bookings**. It will refuse to book and politely ask the user to complete provider selection first.

### 3. ✍️ Alphabet-Matching Constraints (Strict Language Continuity)
*   **Files Modified:** [triage.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/agents/triage.py), [discovery.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/agents/discovery.py), [negotiation.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/agents/negotiation.py), [booking.py](file:///b:/hackathone0-ai-employee/Ustad-G-project-hacathone/Backend/app/agents/booking.py)
*   **What was changed:** Updated the **Language Policy** in all agents with a strict **CRITICAL SCRIPT RULE**.
*   **Impact:** If a user queries in Urdu Script (Arabic alphabet), the agent is strictly prohibited from switching to Roman Urdu or English. It must respond entirely in Urdu Script, preserving language consistency end-to-end!

